Package: pristineR
Title: Tools for Creating Cleaner, Safer, and More Efficient Data Workflows in R.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Laura", "Henze", , "laura.k.henze@lawrence.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: pristineR is an R package designed to simplify common 
data-cleaning and summarization tasks through safer, user-friendly helper 
functions. The package focuses on improving workflow efficiency by handling 
repetitive preprocessing tasks such as date parsing, summary statistics generation, 
and column name cleaning.
